          "message": "fix(go-ci): skip test files when finding wiregen generators (#1126)\n\n## Release note\n\nThe wiregen drift check no longer runs a `package main` app as a generator when its only wiregen import is in a test file. Before this fix such a repo failed the check because the step started the app itself.",
